<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.vessel.composes ~ the pet-named compositions over the vessel primitives

`lares vessel rite <petname>` runs one composition: `founding` (found · stand · lay, halting at the first step that refuses, each idempotent), `refresh` (build · stop · stand) or `rebuild` (re-derive · stand). Bare it lists the rites; an unknown name refuses with exit 2.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ list · founding

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`list` params=`~ list the rites`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`founding` params=`petname/founding ~ found, stand and lay`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ petname

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`petname` params=`takes/word seat/1 as/<founding|refresh|rebuild> ~ the rite`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ runs on this host's own vessel root; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ rite-unknown

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`rite-unknown` params=`cure/[[engine.vessel.composes petname/founding]] ~ name founding, refresh or rebuild`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ ran · halted

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`ran` params=`exit/0 ~ the rite ran whole`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`halted` params=`exit/1 ~ halted at the step that refused, its exit carried`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares vessel rite

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares vessel rite]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

